  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, Domination Immortal Chu Du offers one heaven pillar wind while competing with Fang Yuan for a strength path Immortal Gu. Heaven pillar wind originates from green heaven. It is like a tall pillar, extremely tall and long. When it blows, it does not cause movement, only blowing on the spot, and from outside it resembles a giant pillar that extends into the sky. One heaven pillar wind has high value that does not lose to Feng Jiu Ge’s earlier bid of a hundred and fifty thunder sound leaves. Fang Yuan marks Chu Du as his biggest competitor in that contest.",
      "chapters": [
        754
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-bid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When another room marks up the price, Chu Du has just bid a heaven pillar wind.",
      "chapters": [
        755
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-bid-recalled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan moves stolen resources into the sovereign immortal aperture, Mini Northern Plains holds a heaven pillar wind with the same pillar-like, stationary form described at the auction.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-sighting-in-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later recount of those placements again names a huge heaven pillar wind in Mini Northern Plains.",
